<span class="grey">Housley                   Best Current Practice                [Page 16]</span></pre>
<hr class="noprint"><pre class="newpage"><span id="page-17"></span>
<span class="grey"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><a aria-current="page" href="/info/rfc7696/" class="router-link-active router-link-exact-active whitespace-nowrap" type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed" data-is-nuxt-link><!--[--><!--[-->RFC 7696<!--]--><!--]--></a><!--v-if--><!--]--><!--]--><!----><!--]-->        Guidelines for Cryptographic Alg Agility   November 2015</span>


