             Relations among notions and analysis of the generic
             composition paradigm&quot;, Proceedings of AsiaCrypt &#39;00,
             Springer-Verlag LNCS No. 1976, p. 531,
             DOI 10.1007/3-540-44448-3_41, December 2000.

   [<a id="ref-GCM" data-is-nuxt-link data-non-rfc-anchor-link><!--[--><!--[-->GCM<!--]--><!--]--></a>]     Dworkin, M, &quot;Recommendation for Block Cipher Modes of
             Operation: Galois/Counter Mode (GCM) and GMAC&quot;, NIST
             Special Publication 800-30D, November 2007.

   [<a id="ref-K" data-is-nuxt-link data-non-rfc-anchor-link><!--[--><!--[-->K<!--]--><!--]--></a>]       Krawczyk, H., &quot;The Order of Encryption and Authentication
             for Protecting Communications (or: How Secure Is SSL?)&quot;,
             Proceedings of Crypto &#39;01, Springer-Verlag LNCS No. 2139,
